+<!DOCTYPE html>
+<html lang="en">
+<head>
+  <meta charset="UTF-8">
+  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
+  <meta name="referrer" content="no-referrer">
+  <title>Your Privacy | The Daily Grind</title>
+  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/assets/styles.css">
+</head>
+<body>
+  <nav aria-label="Main navigation">
+    <a class="logo" href="/">THE DAILY GRIND</a>
+    <ul><li><a href="/">Home</a></li><li><a href="/privacy-policy" class="logout-link" aria-current="page">Your Privacy</a></li></ul>
+  </nav>
+  <main class="container">
+    <header class="policy-header">
+      <span class="eyebrow">THE DAILY GRIND · PRIVACY CENTER</span>
+      <h1>Thoughtful coffee.<br>Thoughtful privacy.</h1>
+      <p>Privacy starts with collecting less. Here’s exactly what this website uses, what it doesn’t, and how we protect your visit.</p>
+    </header>
+    <div class="policy-layout">
+      <aside class="policy-nav" aria-label="Privacy topics">
+        <a href="#data">Data we use</a><a href="#choices">Your choices</a><a href="#partners">Third-party review</a><a href="#security">Security</a><a href="#scope">About this policy</a>
+      </aside>
+      <div class="policy-content">
+        <section id="data">
+          <span class="status-badge"><span class="status-dot" aria-hidden="true"></span>No cookies or trackers</span>
+          <h2>Less data, by design.</h2>
+          <p>You can browse without providing a name, email address, location, or account. This site has no forms, payment processing, analytics, advertising trackers, or browser storage.</p>
+          <div class="table-wrap"><table><caption>Website data inventory</caption><thead><tr><th scope="col">Data</th><th scope="col">Purpose</th><th scope="col">Retention in this app</th></tr></thead><tbody>
+            <tr><td>Page and asset requests</td><td>Deliver the page you requested</td><td>Processed in memory; no request logs stored</td></tr>
+            <tr><td>IP address and connection metadata</td><td>Establish the network connection</td><td>No application-level storage</td></tr>
+            <tr><td>Cookies and browsing profiles</td><td>Not used</td><td>Not collected</td></tr>
+            <tr><td>Personal or payment details</td><td>Not requested</td><td>Not collected</td></tr>
+          </tbody></table></div>
+          <p>Network providers and the hosting infrastructure may process connection information under their own retention policies. Those policies must be reviewed by the operator before deployment.</p>
+        </section>
+        <section id="choices"><h2>Your choices stay yours.</h2><p>There are no optional cookies to accept or reject, and no marketing settings to manage. We do not create an identifier or save preferences on your device.</p><p>Because this app does not store personal records, it has no account data to export or delete. Your browser may retain history and downloaded assets; you can clear these using its settings.</p></section>
+        <section id="partners"><h2>A clear view of third parties.</h2><p>All scripts, styles, and images load from this website. The coffee photograph was sourced from Unsplash and is hosted locally, so viewing it does not send a request to Unsplash.</p><p>The app has no runtime third-party packages or integrated data processors. Hosting, CDN, and network services depend on deployment and require a separate review.</p><div class="review-note"><strong>Independent audit status: not performed.</strong><br>The technical inventory is available below. An independent third-party audit must be commissioned separately; we do not claim certification.</div><a class="btn" href="/privacy-review">Read the technical review checklist ↗</a></section>
+        <section id="security"><h2>Protection built into every page.</h2><p>The server restricts scripts, styles, and images to this site, blocks embedding and unused device permissions, and prevents sending referrer information. Pages use a no-store policy, and the app does not log request details.</p><p>Production deployments must use HTTPS. The production server sends a strict transport security header to require secure connections after the first HTTPS visit. Certificates, infrastructure access, and hosting log retention remain the operator’s responsibility.</p></section>
+        <section id="scope"><h2>About this policy.</h2><p>This policy covers the informational Daily Grind website. Ordering, rewards, and account services are not implemented here. Any future service that collects data must have its own documented purpose, retention limit, security review, and clear notice before launch.</p><p>Policy updated October 14, 2026.</p><a href="/">← Back to the coffee</a></section>
+      </div>
+    </div>
+  </main>
+  <footer><div class="footer-links"><a href="/">Home</a> | <a href="/privacy-policy">Privacy</a></div><p>&copy; 2026 The Daily Grind Coffee Co. All rights reserved.</p></footer>
+</body>
+</html>
